--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/add-todo.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+Feature: Adding todos
+  As a todo app user
+  I want to add new todos from the top input
+  So that I can capture what needs doing
+
+  Scenario: Creating a new todo appends it to the list
+    Given the app has no todos
+    When the user types "Buy milk" into the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list shows the todo "Buy milk"
+    And the new todo input is empty
+
+  Scenario: Whitespace-only input creates no todo
+    Given the app has no todos
+    When the user types "   " into the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Leading and trailing whitespace is trimmed from a new todo
+    Given the app has no todos
+    When the user types "  Write tests  " into the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list shows the todo "Write tests"
+
+  Scenario: The new todo input is focused on load
+    Given the app has no todos
+    Then the new todo input is focused
diff --git a/features/clear-completed.feature b/features/clear-completed.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..38489ac
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/clear-completed.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+Feature: Clearing completed todos
+  As a todo app user
+  I want to remove finished items in one action
+  So that the list stays focused on what remains
+
+  Scenario: Clicking clear completed removes completed todos
+    Given the app has the todo "Buy milk"
+    And the app has the completed todo "Write tests"
+    When the user clicks clear completed
+    Then the todo list shows only the todo "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: The clear completed button is hidden when nothing is completed
+    Given the app has the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the clear completed button is not visible
+
+  Scenario: The clear completed button is visible when a todo is completed
+    Given the app has the completed todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the clear completed button is visible
diff --git a/features/complete.feature b/features/complete.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..bb5e963
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/complete.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+Feature: Completing and toggling todos
+  As a todo app user
+  I want to mark todos complete individually or all at once
+  So that I can track what is done
+
+  Scenario: Checking a todo marks it completed
+    Given the app has the todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user checks the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is marked completed
+
+  Scenario: Unchecking a todo marks it active
+    Given the app has the completed todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user unchecks the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not marked completed
+
+  Scenario: Toggling all marks every todo complete
+    Given the app has the todo "Buy milk"
+    And the app has the todo "Write tests"
+    When the user checks the mark all as complete checkbox
+    Then every todo is marked completed
+
+  Scenario: Toggling all again marks every todo active
+    Given the app has the completed todo "Buy milk"
+    And the app has the completed todo "Write tests"
+    When the user unchecks the mark all as complete checkbox
+    Then every todo is not marked completed
+
+  Scenario: The mark-all checkbox becomes checked when all todos are complete
+    Given the app has the todo "Buy milk"
+    And the app has the todo "Write tests"
+    When the user checks the todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user checks the todo "Write tests"
+    Then the mark all as complete checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: The mark-all checkbox becomes unchecked when a todo is unchecked
+    Given the app has the completed todo "Buy milk"
+    And the app has the completed todo "Write tests"
+    When the user unchecks the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the mark all as complete checkbox is unchecked
+
+  Scenario: Clearing completed todos resets the mark-all checkbox
+    Given the app has the todo "Buy milk"
+    And the app has the todo "Write tests"
+    When the user checks the mark all as complete checkbox
+    And the user clicks clear completed
+    Then the mark all as complete checkbox is unchecked
diff --git a/features/counter.feature b/features/counter.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..8b4a8cf
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/counter.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+Feature: Active todo counter
+  As a todo app user
+  I want to see how many items remain
+  So that I can gauge my remaining work
+
+  Scenario: The active count is wrapped in a strong element
+    Given the app has the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the counter's strong element contains "1"
+
+  Scenario Outline: The counter pluralizes the active count
+    Given the app has <active> active todos
+    Then the counter shows "<active> <plural> left"
+
+    Examples:
+      | active | plural |
+      | 1      | item   |
+      | 2      | items  |
+      | 5      | items  |
